            <section id="event-1" class="event-section">
                <h1 class="event-title">TOUCH & RELEASE</h1>
                <h2 class="event-subtitle">A SUMMER’S END PROCESSION & CONCERT</h2>
                <div class="event-meta">SEPTEMBER 17, 2026 | LOS ANGELES RIVER, FROGTOWN</div>
                
                <div class="event-layout">
                    <div class="event-main">
                        
                        <!-- Images Above Description -->
                        <div class="image-grid" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <img src="tr 34 w mini logo.jpg" alt="Touch & Release">
                            <img src="TR_DSC00015.jpeg" alt="Touch & Release">
                        </div>

                        <div class="event-description">
                            <p>A shared river between two bordering habitats generates new dynamic life. Ripe with variation. Summer has had her way with us all, leaving our focus pleasantly frayed and scattered across the season. Before fall’s arrival, we gather together for a homecoming in three acts grounded with the ancient custom of Tashlich.</p>
                            <p>The LA River is our city's most tangible natural vein; channelized, concrete, yet alive. We playfully breach that boundary through physical contact, and sound. After sunset, the river will be lit and amplified with site-specific performances from Jake Chapman on vibraphone and Eva Myra May on synth & hardware.</p>
                            
                            <div class="boxed-text">
                                Process guides for Touch & Release: priming receptivity on individual and collective levels /:/ openness to the process of letting go /:/ the edge effect [ecologically & culturally] /:/ the custom of tashlich
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Images Below Description -->
                        <div class="grid-varied">
                            <img src="TR_DSC00001-Edit-Edit.jpeg" alt="Touch & Release" class="span-3">
                            <img src="TR_DSC00010-Edit-Edit.jpeg" alt="Touch & Release" class="span-2">
                            <img src="TR_DSC00033.jpeg" alt="Touch & Release">
                            <img src="TR_DSC00011-Edit-Edit.jpeg" alt="Touch & Release">
                            <img src="TR_IMG_20260928_0004-Edit.jpeg" alt="Touch & Release" class="span-2">
                        </div>

                        <div class="photo-credit">
                            <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/camera" title="camera icons" target="_blank">
                                <svg class="camera-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"></circle></svg>
                            </a>
                            SHELLY BADAL
                        </div>
